<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/4th-century">4th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">378 CE</h1><p class="ref-lede">378 CE in world history: 8 events and 3 deaths. 134 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
<nav class="ref-letters yr-near" aria-label="Nearby years"><a href="/years/260">260 CE</a><a href="/years/328">328 CE</a><a href="/years/357">357 CE</a><a href="/years/363">363 CE</a><a href="/years/378" aria-current="page">378 CE</a><a href="/years/392">392 CE</a><a href="/years/394">394 CE</a><a href="/years/410">410 CE</a><a href="/years/420">420 CE</a></nav>
<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/august-9">9 August</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Goths destroy a Roman army and kill Emperor Valens at Adrianople</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Gothic cavalry and infantry overwhelmed the Eastern Roman army near Adrianople in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thrace">Thrace</a>, killing Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/valens">Valens</a> and much of his force. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> was never again able to expel the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/goths">Goths</a> from its territory.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/roman-empire">Roman Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/valens">Valens</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-adrianople">Battle of Adrianople</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Adrianople was fought in 378 CE in Thrace between the Roman army under the eastern emperor Valens and Gothic forces.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Battle</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-argentovaria">Battle of Argentovaria</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Battle of Argentovaria was fought in 378 in Alsace between the Western Roman army of the emperor Gratian and the Alemannic Lentienses, who had crossed the frozen Rhine.</p></div></li></ol></section>
